  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "21819a49-fe17-48bb-8c39-065a5cb87d9e",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Bfexplorer and Betfair data setup\n\nLoad the required Bfexplorer and Betfair WebAPI assemblies and open the namespaces used by the F# data retrieval code."
    },
    {
      "id": "b6a0a0be-e1fd-424f-b66e-fe151863be9e",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "fsharp",
      "source": "//#I @\u0022E:\\Projects\\Bfexplorer\\Development\\Applications\\BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.App\\bin\\Debug\\net10.0-windows\u0022\r\n\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Data.dll\u0022\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain.dll\u0022\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Service.Core.dll\u0022\r\n\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Betfair.WebAPI.Selenium.dll\u0022\r\n\r\nopen System.Collections.Generic\r\n\r\nopen BeloSoft.Data\r\nopen BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain\r\nopen BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain.Data\r\nopen BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Service\r\n\r\nopen BeloSoft.Betfair.WebAPI.Selenium.Models"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f0e87ff-1b79-41d9-ad9b-ed01abf86e0d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Market selection data retrieval\n\nRetrieve the currently active Bfexplorer market and selection, request traded prices and price history data for that market-selection pair, and print the returned data structure."
    },
    {
      "id": "fdb708ac-343d-4ead-ad64-b30bf49758e4",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "fsharp",
      "source": "let result =\r\n    let iBfexplorer = (bfexplorer :\u003E IBfexplorerConsole).Bfexplorer\r\n\r\n    let market = iBfexplorer.ActiveMarket\r\n    let selection = iBfexplorer.ActiveSelection\r\n\r\n    iBfexplorer.GetDataContextForMarketSelection([| \u0022MarketSelectionsTradedPricesData\u0022; \u0022MarketSelectionsPriceHistoryData\u0022 |], market, selection) \r\n    |\u003E Async.RunSynchronously\r\n\r\nmatch result with\r\n| DataResult.Success data -\u003E\r\n\r\n    for selectionData in data.SelectionsData do\r\n        printfn \u0022%s - %A\u0022 selectionData.Name selectionData.Data\r\n    \r\n    let activeSelectionData = data.SelectionsData.[0]\r\n    let timePriceVolumes = activeSelectionData.Data.[\u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022] :?\u003E TimePriceVolume []\r\n\r\n    Variables.Set(\u0022selection\u0022, activeSelectionData.Selection)\r\n    Variables.Set(\u0022timePriceVolumes\u0022, timePriceVolumes)\r\n\r\n| DataResult.Failure errorMessage -\u003E printfn \u0022Failed to GetDataContextForMarketSelection %s\u0022 errorMessage",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Court In A Storm - seq\n  [[tradedPricesData, { BackRatio = 0.8157601713\n  EndPrice = 2.0\n  LayRatio = 0.1842398287\n  MaxPrice = 2.06\n  MinPrice = 1.99\n  StartPrice = 2.04\n  TradedVolume = 583.75 }];\n   [timePriceVolumes, BeloSoft.Betfair.WebAPI.Selenium.Models.TimePriceVolume[]]]\r\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c3b729a9-e899-43ba-aff1-547b5a03d3cd",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Convert F# time-price-volume data to pandas\n\nTransform the returned selection time-price-volume data into a pandas DataFrame for analysis and plotting."
    },
    {
      "id": "4dd0ad55-ad5b-4d5e-a3a7-76d239997057",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "source": "import pandas as pd\r\nfrom datetime import datetime\r\n\r\ndf = pd.DataFrame([\r\n    {\r\n        \u0022Time\u0022: datetime(\r\n            tpv.Time.Year,\r\n            tpv.Time.Month,\r\n            tpv.Time.Day,\r\n            tpv.Time.Hour,\r\n            tpv.Time.Minute,\r\n            tpv.Time.Second,\r\n            tpv.Time.Millisecond * 1000\r\n        ),\r\n        \u0022Price\u0022: tpv.Price,\r\n        \u0022Volume\u0022: tpv.Volume\r\n    }\r\n    for tpv in timePriceVolumes\r\n])\r\n\r\ndf",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv\u003E\n\u003Cstyle scoped\u003E\n    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe thead th {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n\u003C/style\u003E\n\u003Ctable border=\u00221\u0022 class=\u0022dataframe\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Cthead\u003E\n    \u003Ctr style=\u0022text-align: right;\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003ETime\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003EPrice\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003EVolume\u003C/th\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n  \u003C/thead\u003E\n  \u003Ctbody\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E0\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-15 18:39:41\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E3.52\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E1.88\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E1\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-15 18:39:41\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E3.47\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E6.64\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E2\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-15 18:47:42\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E3.42\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E14.00\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E3\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-15 20:08:34\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E3.47\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E1.48\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E4\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-15 20:14:43\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E3.57\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E3.74\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E...\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E...\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E...\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E...\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E543\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-16 18:50:17\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2.00\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E174.06\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E544\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-16 18:50:24\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2.02\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E18.00\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E545\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-16 18:50:36\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2.00\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E50.90\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E546\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-16 18:51:36\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E1.99\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E35.44\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n    \u003Ctr\u003E\n      \u003Cth\u003E547\u003C/th\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2026-04-16 18:51:51\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E2.00\u003C/td\u003E\n      \u003Ctd\u003E5.22\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003C/tr\u003E\n  \u003C/tbody\u003E\n\u003C/table\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E548 rows \u00D7 3 columns\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05537901-062f-4a4f-8203-e46dc8d87bd5",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Plot selection price and volume time series\n\nCreate a two-panel chart showing the market selection price over time and the traded volume at each timestamp."
    },
    {
      "id": "2e3d21ba-17b8-4230-9d54-078e0d5b7ba1",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "source": "import seaborn as sns\r\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\r\n\r\nsns.set_theme(style=\u0022whitegrid\u0022)\r\nfig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(2, 1, sharex=True, figsize=(10, 6), gridspec_kw={\u0022height_ratios\u0022: [3, 1]})\r\n\r\nsns.lineplot(data=df, x=\u0022Time\u0022, y=\u0022Price\u0022, marker=\u0022\u0022, ax=ax1, label=\u0022Price\u0022)\r\nax2.bar(df[\u0022Time\u0022], df[\u0022Volume\u0022], width=0.003, color=\u0022skyblue\u0022, align=\u0022center\u0022)\r\n\r\nax1.set_title(\u0022Time vs Price\u0022)\r\nax1.set_ylabel(\u0022Price\u0022)\r\nax2.set_title(\u0022Volume\u0022)\r\nax2.set_ylabel(\u0022Volume\u0022)\r\nax2.set_xlabel(\u0022Time\u0022)\r\n\r\nfig.autofmt_xdate()\r\nplt.tight_layout()\r\nplt.show()",
      "outputs": [
